*.cab
*.msi
*.msix
*.msm
*.msp

# Linux system files
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# Archive files (typically temporary)
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.dmg
*.iso

